*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% LE SPOOLER - a pretend fanfold daisywheel printer.
*% Text, PDF and PostScript go unfiltered to the lespooler backend, which
*% converts them to plain text itself (control characters survive intact).
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "0.2"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "LESPOOL.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "LE SPOOLER"
*Product: "(LE SPOOLER)"
*ModelName: "LE SPOOLER Fanfold Daisywheel"
*ShortNickName: "LE SPOOLER Fanfold"
*NickName: "LE SPOOLER Fanfold Daisywheel (text)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter2: "text/plain application/vnd.cups-raw 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/vnd.cups-raw 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "application/postscript application/vnd.cups-raw 0 -"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:LE SPOOLER;MDL:Fanfold Daisywheel;CMD:TXT,PDF;CLS:PRINTER;"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Paper: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Fanfold
*PageSize Fanfold/Fanfold 9.5x11in: "<</PageSize[684 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Fanfold
*PageRegion Fanfold/Fanfold 9.5x11in: "<</PageSize[684 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Fanfold
*ImageableArea Fanfold: "36 18 648 774"
*ImageableArea Letter: "18 18 594 774"
*ImageableArea A4: "18 18 577 824"
*DefaultPaperDimension: Fanfold
*PaperDimension Fanfold: "684 792"
*PaperDimension Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension A4: "595 842"

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
